        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Intermediate Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nIntermediate pivot hinge for taller doors that require additional support to keep the middle part of the door in line with the pivot hinges at the top and bottom. Used by Kawneer and other door manufactures.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCannot be used with center hung doors.  Not intended to be load bearing.  For use only with 3/4\" offset pivot hinges.  Available in Aluminum or Duranodic finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-BD1023-installed.jpg?v=1704354549\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Jackson J-190 pivot set size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of DC-807 Intermediate Pivot Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Leaf Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>3/4\" Offset</li>\r\n<li>Fully Mortised </li>\r\n<li>For use with Aluminum Storefront Doors</li>\r\n<li>Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC-807.pdf?v=1704262276\" target=\"new\"><b>Jackson J-190 Intermediate Pivot Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 pivot set)</b>\r\n</p>",
